  "answer_text": "Here is the login information for **PreLicenseTraining.com**:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd10 PreLicenseTraining.com Login\n\n**PreLicenseTraining.com** offers insurance pre-license training and continuing education courses online for insurance professionals.\n\nYou can access the login pages below:\n\n| Portal | Link |\n|---|---|\n| \ud83c\udf93 **Student Login** | [prelicensetraining.com/login](https://prelicensetraining.com/login) |\n| \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udfeb **Mentor/Recruiter Login** | [prelicensetraining.com/ca/mentor/register](https://prelicensetraining.com/ca/mentor/register) |\n| \ud83d\udcdd **New User Registration** | [prelicensetraining.com/register](https://prelicensetraining.com/register) |\n\n---\n\n### Tips:\n- If you **already have an account**, go directly to the [Login Page](https://prelicensetraining.com/login).\n- If you are a **new user**, you can register at the [Registration Page](https://prelicensetraining.com/register).\n- If you are a **Mentor or Recruiter**, use the dedicated [Mentor Portal](https://prelicensetraining.com/ca/mentor/register).\n\nIf you're having trouble logging in, look for a **\"Forgot Password\"** option on the login page, or contact PreLicenseTraining.com's support team directly through their website.",
